{"2085660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Devices Tycoon","steam_appid":2085660,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5254030],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Devices Tycoon!<\/h2>This is a unique business simulator that will allow you to feel like the owner of a company to create your own devices! In the game you can create your own <strong>smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart watches, headphones, TVs, operating systems and even your own processors<\/strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/550805852e8791e7e56ffdd22e09a2ba.avif?t=1792166456\" width=576 height=347 \/><\/span><br><br><strong>Choose the name of your company, the country in which your company will be created, start-up capital and start creating history!<\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/8fc954d8006f505aab9f349024d0d19f.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=324 \/><\/span><br><br>Hire the best employees for your company: designers, programmers and engineers all over the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/b77783467e8ae9347d1d7bf1232d6bac.avif?t=1792166456\" width=543 height=347 \/><\/span><br><br>A detailed and realistic device editor will be available to you in the game. You can choose the device size, color, screen, processor, graphics card, speakers, packaging and much more. More than 10,000 different functions are waiting for you to edit your devices, it all depends on your imagination.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/ad088fe4b63b0f39af27c32038df5280.avif?t=1792166456\" width=617 height=400 \/><\/span><br><br>When your first devices start appearing on store shelves, you will have the first customer reviews. The higher the score, the better the sales!<br><br>Offices for your employees will also be available to you in the game. Buy and upgrade more than 16 offices for designers, programmers and engineers!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/45a8fd5081c2b91572468863553d8c8d.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=347 \/><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/76d068d9d3028e5c56f84094adff3c2f.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=347 \/><\/span><br>You will also be able to hold presentations of your devices before the start of sales, study marketing, view ratings of other companies around the world, open your own stores around the world, negotiate and buy other companies!<br><br>Of course, these are not all the functions in the game, but it's better to try it yourself! Have a nice game!","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Devices Tycoon!<\/h2>This is a unique business simulator that will allow you to feel like the owner of a company to create your own devices! In the game you can create your own <strong>smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart watches, headphones, TVs, operating systems and even your own processors<\/strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/550805852e8791e7e56ffdd22e09a2ba.avif?t=1792166456\" width=576 height=347 \/><\/span><br><br><strong>Choose the name of your company, the country in which your company will be created, start-up capital and start creating history!<\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/8fc954d8006f505aab9f349024d0d19f.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=324 \/><\/span><br><br>Hire the best employees for your company: designers, programmers and engineers all over the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/b77783467e8ae9347d1d7bf1232d6bac.avif?t=1792166456\" width=543 height=347 \/><\/span><br><br>A detailed and realistic device editor will be available to you in the game. You can choose the device size, color, screen, processor, graphics card, speakers, packaging and much more. More than 10,000 different functions are waiting for you to edit your devices, it all depends on your imagination.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/ad088fe4b63b0f39af27c32038df5280.avif?t=1792166456\" width=617 height=400 \/><\/span><br><br>When your first devices start appearing on store shelves, you will have the first customer reviews. The higher the score, the better the sales!<br><br>Offices for your employees will also be available to you in the game. Buy and upgrade more than 16 offices for designers, programmers and engineers!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/45a8fd5081c2b91572468863553d8c8d.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=347 \/><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/extras\/76d068d9d3028e5c56f84094adff3c2f.avif?t=1792166456\" width=616 height=347 \/><\/span><br>You will also be able to hold presentations of your devices before the start of sales, study marketing, view ratings of other companies around the world, open your own stores around the world, negotiate and buy other companies!<br><br>Of course, these are not all the functions in the game, but it's better to try it yourself! Have a nice game!","short_description":"Devices Tycoon is a unique business simulator that will make you feel like the owner of a company that creates your own devices! In the game you can create your own smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart watches, headphones, operating systems and even your own processors!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Indonesian, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hindi, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/cfbec389b36849ce4a04b5f19e4a88ca68c73d16\/header.jpg?t=1792166456","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/3af43d2815b5d3c693b0d7db212b5780bf947012\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792166456","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/3af43d2815b5d3c693b0d7db212b5780bf947012\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792166456","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows® 7 Home 32 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz Single Core<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows® 7 Home 64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo 3.0 Ghz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 460 1GB<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Roastery Games"],"publishers":["Roastery Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1999,"final":1999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$19.99"},"packages":[745298],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Devices Tycoon","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":745298,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Devices Tycoon - $19.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/07253b55a0866b5bb5c8846bd404cb76284d3929\/ss_07253b55a0866b5bb5c8846bd404cb76284d3929.600x338.jpg?t=1792166456","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/07253b55a0866b5bb5c8846bd404cb76284d3929\/ss_07253b55a0866b5bb5c8846bd404cb76284d3929.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792166456"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/12f4b838ab1de419198e174fdd6107d1043a33c8\/ss_12f4b838ab1de419198e174fdd6107d1043a33c8.600x338.jpg?t=1792166456","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2085660\/12f4b838ab1de419198e174fdd6107d1043a33c8\/ss_12f4b838ab1de419198e174fdd6107d1043a33